    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "On a perusal of the record, it appears that the petitioners being aggrieved with the judgment of Appellate Court passed in Criminal Appeal No. 20 of 2014 has preferred this revision challenging the order affirming the judgment passed by learned Municipal Magistrate, 3rd Court in Case No. 7D of 2008 under Section 16(1)(a)(i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act.",
